          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>$\\bar X \\sim N(\\mu, 32/16) = N(\\mu, 2)$ and $\\bar Y \\sim N(\\mu, 50/25) = N(\\mu, 2)$. Independent, so $\\bar X - \\bar Y \\sim N(0, 2+2) = N(0,4)$, giving SD $=2$. Then $P(\\bar X - \\bar Y > 5) = P\\!\\left(Z > \\dfrac{5-0}{2}\\right) = P(Z > 2.5) = 0.006$.</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>$\\bar X \\sim N(\\mu, 32/16) = N(\\mu, 2)$ và $\\bar Y \\sim N(\\mu, 50/25) = N(\\mu, 2)$. Hai mẫu độc lập nên $\\bar X - \\bar Y \\sim N(0, 2+2) = N(0,4)$, tức độ lệch chuẩn $=2$. Do đó $P(\\bar X - \\bar Y > 5) = P\\!\\left(Z > \\dfrac{5-0}{2}\\right) = P(Z > 2{,}5) = 0{,}006$.</p></div>"
