          "explanation": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><p>Pooled variance: $s_p^2 = \\dfrac{(n_1-1)s_1^2 + (n_2-1)s_2^2}{n_1+n_2-2} = \\dfrac{24(2.25) + 29(3.61)}{53} = \\dfrac{54 + 104.69}{53} = 2.9942$, so $s_p = 1.7304$. Standard error $= s_p\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{25}+\\frac{1}{30}} = 1.7304\\sqrt{0.07333} = 0.4686$. Then $t_0 = \\dfrac{20-18}{0.4686} \\approx 4.27$ (positive, since $\\bar x_1 > \\bar x_2$).</p></div><div class=\"ml-vi\"><p>Phương sai gộp: $s_p^2 = \\dfrac{(n_1-1)s_1^2 + (n_2-1)s_2^2}{n_1+n_2-2} = \\dfrac{24(2{,}25) + 29(3{,}61)}{53} = \\dfrac{158{,}69}{53} = 2{,}9942$, nên $s_p = 1{,}7304$. Sai số chuẩn $= s_p\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{25}+\\frac{1}{30}} = 1{,}7304\\sqrt{0{,}07333} = 0{,}4686$. Vậy $t_0 = \\dfrac{20-18}{0{,}4686} \\approx 4{,}27$ (dương vì $\\bar x_1 > \\bar x_2$).</p></div>"
